8. INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

❓ Is Big O actual execution time?
✔ No. It measures growth rate, not seconds.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Does Big O always mean Worst Case?

✔ Technically, Big O is the upper bound.
It is commonly used for worst-case analysis.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Is Big Θ Average Case?

✘ No.

Big Θ = Tight Bound

Average Case is a separate concept.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Is Average Case = (Best + Worst) / 2 ?

✘ No.

Average Case = Expected complexity over all possible inputs.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Why ignore constants?

✔ Because Big O measures asymptotic growth, and constants become insignificant for large inputs.

